893
00:39:53.824 --> 00:39:55.092 align:center line:85% position:50% size:40%
我爱你,妈妈。

894
00:39:55.226 --> 00:39:57.194 align:center line:85% position:50% size:60%
我也爱你,甜蜜。

895
