918
00:41:18.943 --> 00:41:21.412 align:center line:79% position:49% size:78%
[男孩] Keesha 想摆脱尽可能多的震动

919
00:41:21.545 --> 00:41:23.047 align:center line:85% position:50% size:70%
妈妈的自行车,不是吗?

920
00:41:23.414 --> 00:41:25.749 align:center line:79% position:51% size:73%
